The legislative texts in this repository are from e-qanun.az, the Unified Internet Electronic Database of Legal Acts
of the Ministry of Justice of the Republic of Azerbaijan (https://e-qanun.az). Under article 7(a) of the Law of the
Republic of Azerbaijan on Copyright and Related Rights (No. 115-IQ, 5 June 1996), official documents (laws, court decisions and other
texts of a legislative, administrative or judicial nature) and their official translations are not objects of
copyright. e-qanun publishes no terms of use. The texts are reproduced without change to their wording; note
references are renumbered per file and the official-publication references inside e-qanun's notes are removed.

Lexifina's own contributions (tools, file arrangement, commit messages and documentation) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
